+## 源码提交
+
+改动全部位于 `feature/rewrite-ui` 分支，基线为
+`d73f6295e8252ed2f7b9c12bae32e9001b1afdaa`，共 7 个提交：
+
+```text
+28e627e perf(WeaselUI): use software Direct2D render target for panel
+18942af feat(rewrite-ui): bridge indexed rewrite properties through IPC context
+d052fb4 feat(rewrite-ui): draw syllable cells, active highlight and index badge
+4d9e211 fix(WeaselSetup): trim command-line whitespace and add opt-in setup tracing
+fd33dc1 test(rewrite-ui): add state, IPC pipeline and librime property tests
+44e2972 chore(build): add rewrite build, package, activation and patch scripts
+1e2fd4e docs(rewrite-ui): document the rewrite UI patch and example config
+```
+
+其中 `4d9e211` 同时包含命令行首尾空白归一（修掉参数尾部空格导致 `/s` 未识别、
+进入隐藏交互窗口的问题）和 `WEASEL_SETUP_LOG` 门控的安装 trace；两者落在同一个
+代码块内，无法干净拆分。trace 不设置该环境变量时零开销。
+
+`git remote` 目前只有 `origin`，直接指向官方 `rime/weasel`，**尚未 Fork、
+也没有 `upstream`**；同步上游前需要先补做。
+
+## 已知遗留
+
+| 项 | 说明 |
+|---|---|
+| 删除 `indexed_rewrite_tab_ui_v2.lua` | 已不被任何 schema 引用，文件仍在 `%APPDATA%\Rime\lua\` |
+| 移除核心 Lua 里的 `sync_ui()` | 多余的 `env.engine:compose(ctx)` 调用，重绘现在由 Weasel 负责 |
+| 补测三项验收 | 多位索引 badge 肉眼确认、`Space`/`Enter`/标点提交、`head_replace` |
+| 补做 Fork 与 `upstream` | 见上 |
+| `rewrite_ui/*` 颜色配置 | 目前只复用主题参数，未新增独立颜色键 |
+
+重新出包请运行 `package-rewrite.ps1`；它会同时刷新本文件（作为包内 `README.md`）、
+`rewrite-source.zip` 和 `SHA256SUMS.txt`。改动 Weasel 侧二进制后，必须重新安装
+并重跑上面的验收项。
diff --git a/rewrite-ui.custom.example.yaml b/rewrite-ui.custom.example.yaml
index 793fe0b..3a56128 100644
--- a/rewrite-ui.custom.example.yaml
+++ b/rewrite-ui.custom.example.yaml
@@ -7,3 +7,11 @@ patch:
 # hilited_back_color, hilited_text_color, text_color,
 # style/layout/corner_radius, hilite_padding_x/y and hilite_spacing.
 # The index badge uses one third of the highlight background opacity.
+#
+# After editing these keys, restart WeaselServer.exe. A full redeploy is NOT
+# needed: weasel.yaml contains no rewrite_ui/* keys, and the server merges the
+# patch map from weasel.custom.yaml when it loads the config at startup.
+#
+# rewrite_ui/debug: true writes the codes being typed to
+# %TEMP%\rime.weasel\rewrite-ui.log. Turn it back off and restart the server
+# when the investigation is finished.
